{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_00e53cc6633f6bddee4cade1ed3598f8dc6cd73854e7f8671bd2dded45883172","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0b99a56f3cd7da051965fde8dc51cbb5d2deabbb4b9b8ec483f172d6e5978c05","slc_4d5adc85d761ae7a84bad4b082aa455dd160d83390624ee001220fe920f8c04d"],"source_ids":["src_4f339094fadb542a85605b599c4b63de"],"text":"The permission system is implemented as a before_call callback on the chain (raising llm.CancelToolCall on denial), with --allow patterns and --yolo skipping prompts; approvals are session-scoped and not persisted.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_01e602b4a3b3c60f70407054fd9b8dbfb7f0bc9c6a149bd07577933ebe8e0ac9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_04dc95e39c2a848b9957859705b579199cb3b46b8dd6fabd1b0c82ab11dc2709","slc_15311fceded8c8772d1400d062f7ba27d3cff4da50eef02f4e548ee349ead733"],"source_ids":["src_4f339094fadb542a85605b599c4b63de","src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"All file access is confined to the session root: paths escaping via '..', absolute paths, or symlinks return an 'Error:' string instead of content, letting the model self-correct.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_05a130e5c22ae8f56894e63c7adbc40240b8c70ecb7926309e1f96f2b2008b3c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_84c78b4ab044f1c529cf4f23241fa2fd2c96fe42561eba4f036c8d383866b33b"],"source_ids":["src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"Installing the package as an LLM plugin adds an `llm code` command that starts an interactive coding agent session in the current directory with any tool-capable model LLM supports.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2c1c5848689dbe4f5688bfedf3b1342d78ee8fd27a944634004f90efa1827a65","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_553a56b7fe11977c2ec9d3b4c91fa69c083d123ccde57827838ebe88fa9d95c2","slc_71e050135180f5a6becab5389a82b17caadee1212e531fce756866590c168780"],"source_ids":["src_4f339094fadb542a85605b599c4b63de","src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"edit_file performs exact string replacement requiring old_string to appear exactly once unless replace_all is set, and returns a unified diff so the model can verify its edit.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_32ed866bcd5a9f97c53a291aabbd26ec1f96a6bc3e8608f9f366cd3b7c11ced8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0c82a614e7f8e5f3d783c5e87f542224fc4150e13c973775714b6f0080227950","slc_79e09faf58d2ab11b7d05ddde280c2a1a33427b14cb81fb145fbd0096733f4e3","slc_b47bcea6a58d8dce5c23a972f621694d8286a6a11074d18bba6d337f43cd6751"],"source_ids":["src_4f339094fadb542a85605b599c4b63de","src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"Sessions are logged to LLM's SQLite database like `llm chat`, so `llm logs` shows full transcripts including tool calls, and conversations can be resumed via -c or --cid.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_37698841144f6e248c0570549c1451204410ec42d3e5e15ea26e0dcbea3b680c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4d5adc85d761ae7a84bad4b082aa455dd160d83390624ee001220fe920f8c04d","slc_551f96d9e25b42e8f7d9a4778ac9b1393cfdf53d1d4715128846a7c20387e9e4"],"source_ids":["src_4f339094fadb542a85605b599c4b63de","src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"Read-only tools run freely, while writes, edits, and shell commands require approval; 'y' approves once, 'a' approves similar actions for the session, and denial is reported back to the model.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3b973c5f241e60d897fa48bc5fceb0613d81ffe76c19e9fa6ef59c839a042462","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_26ae0ac19bf14a4879ac6f03b81fc6870ef3d9daa4bce288d0be1a7a026d88e1","slc_b2e856c40ce8928ff6296c1f7bb4095cf61b886338a8917d7a9ef4a62c906bca"],"source_ids":["src_4f339094fadb542a85605b599c4b63de","src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"The `llm code` CLI accepts options including an initial prompt, -m/--model, -s/--system, -d/--directory, --yolo, repeatable --allow glob patterns, --no-tool, -c/--continue, --cid, -o model options, and --chain-limit.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_70a40b8d7668a1e5e247e0904d1dbb2ba96dfcd85cde3b714f0ad26761eaff98","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6ff536fb74d86e068d11627fcaebe44882a5c63f459bdc846aaec8b791a49a1f","slc_b3144c80a06655358e7a15206c2c03574bc5e91e4e625845d11163921ce73e67","slc_cde09404f4b444bc3fb06c396c75261bbf3d8dd247e7510ca2675eef637fb308"],"source_ids":["src_4f339094fadb542a85605b599c4b63de","src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"The package requires Python 3.10+ and pins llm>=0.32a3, needing pip install --pre until LLM 0.32 is stable; it has no other runtime dependencies beyond what llm brings.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_77c31256546cc921ba24364dc1db10558798a76b2e05b6d3f52701f826c9df48","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7a013b61966e4538cc287b967d4d8970370160573e9504a709dd1c1d9620286b","slc_94688e68be36921fc3ba477117d2b6e485c19f3c7825aad73959ff68ca030681","slc_ae1845c9359f652ef9c6051dbccf2e324ec94cda4d18629b78661cf366a8c006","slc_c459be00212b59aa2affcad3b5b77e9b86a6aca1f7a94eec8207801051d549fe"],"source_ids":["src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"CodingTools is an llm.Toolbox confined to a root directory providing read_file, write_file, edit_file, list_files, search_files, and execute_command tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_933b7538f182d389a8a6f45f7f4832787bb3819eb9e261eda01d65ce6550c0ee","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bc36f1701343407b846db7778d0a5fd64e30b51f9b05cd67552ac19682645d55"],"source_ids":["src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors create a virtualenv, install with `python -m pip install -e '.[test]'`, and run tests via `python -m pytest`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a7de350f2d97856f6fd0b7302d524d57ba3d6ed9b52bfc97373fa184b6958693","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_eaa110d9951adc13a1a24f06d9acca3d1dd81080cfbcf77c04d7cf331b235da6"],"source_ids":["src_4f339094fadb542a85605b599c4b63de"],"text":"The spec lists non-goals for the initial release: no sandboxing or containerization (safety comes from the approval flow), no MCP, sub-agents, git or IDE integration, and no Windows-specific shell handling.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ba6ecd1deaba4c0493baada9920faa08f560a8dba835e9484a48deda377495b2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"simonw/llm-coding-agent@01dbde5897fc snapshot 0a77211a52823127","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_78045b98c2c0f0b432d46a927b1dad9cf1a1a0a9b81ef21b225a52ae5c5cbeb7","slc_ce478fd42d49b205f68f9c93fe90f14ea2ecda46f4c9ca3063d88a0055c5a572"],"source_ids":["src_4f339094fadb542a85605b599c4b63de","src_564dd00c461252a69e0de3c384820aa7"],"text":"The agent loop uses conversation.chain with a chain_limit (default 25) bounding tool-execution rounds per run; hitting the limit sets result.hit_limit and returns control to the user.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:39:56Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b56015c5c5d941728652e2ed3622ab01"}
